<section class="section" id="what" style="--h: 1; --hm: 2">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Agent sessions in the notch</h2>
      <p>Morrow watches the agents you already run. Nothing has to be pasted into a new window.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fill cards-fill">
      <div class="what-copy">
        <div class="what-item">
          <h3>Sessions</h3>
          <p>Every agent appears with its source, current tool and last answer.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="what-item">
          <h3>Approvals</h3>
          <p>Permission prompts land in the panel. Approve or deny there, and the tool call keeps its real result.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="what-item">
          <h3>Music playback</h3>
          <p>Track, lyrics and volume stay in the right wing. Prayer reminders and status badges follow one priority rule.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="what-shot"><img src="images/readme-question.png" alt="A question card from the Morrow desktop panel" width="1200" height="800" /></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
